        """F6 — Deut 8:19-20: if you surely forget (the case), other gods served and bowed (the second word by CALL — the order reversed), I TESTIFY — THE WRITE (4:26's effect reused), like the nations (the ban by kind — the measure for measure), because (the heel), hearke

