==== cold_run_second_census.the_roll sig ('case', 'data') (8125 chars) asks-in-source ['daughters_row', 'deltas', 'ephraim_manasseh_order', 'er_and_onan', 'families', 'genesis_46', 'hu_dathan', 'korach_recalled', 'korachs_dead', 'reuben_firstborn', 'serah', 'simeons_gap', 'single_son_plural', 'sons_of_korach', 'total', 'twelve_counts']
